WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:02.730
Io, the moon Jupiter never lets rest.

00:03.430 --> 00:12.260
Io goes round Jupiter every 42 hours, pulled one way by the planet and the other by two moons further out, in time with it.

00:12.710 --> 00:17.965
All that kneading has to go somewhere, and it comes out of hundreds of volcanoes.
